  "hero": "https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Ne2eWOfbyyw/YFuq-x2usyI/AAAAAAABIQ8/vOkks5Xd1vsAkfD2PR6shnqaTeDHJADhgCPcBGAsYHg/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/IMG_20210323_145715.jpg",
  "html": "<div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Ne2eWOfbyyw/YFuq-x2usyI/AAAAAAABIQ8/vOkks5Xd1vsAkfD2PR6shnqaTeDHJADhgCPcBGAsYHg/s3264/IMG_20210323_145715.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Ne2eWOfbyyw/YFuq-x2usyI/AAAAAAABIQ8/vOkks5Xd1vsAkfD2PR6shnqaTeDHJADhgCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_145715.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><b>Laikas</b>: 30-40 min.<br><b>Kaina</b>: nedidelė<br><br><b>Jums reikės:</b><br>Sojų kubeliai, 100 gr<br>1 svogūnas<br>1 morkas<br>1 pomidoras<br>1 česnakas<br>1 lauro lapas<br>2 kvapnieji pipirai<br>Alyvuogių aliejus<br>1 šaukštas miltų<div><br></div><div><b>Paruošimas:</b></div><br><br>1. Užverdame vandenį su prieskoniais, pavyzdžiui, mėsos. Į jį sudedame sojų kubelius ir verdame 10-15 min.<div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9K5LcBsT5Ig/YFuoH-5OQ_I/AAAAAAABIQA/HfCCbaTXuMI7_HWDCf8ErwTSVPJZJKN7QCPcBGAsYHg/s2669/IMG_20210323_135440.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9K5LcBsT5Ig/YFuoH-5OQ_I/AAAAAAABIQA/HfCCbaTXuMI7_HWDCf8ErwTSVPJZJKN7QCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_135440.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-XFxgYDq_RRU/YFuoQxcdn1I/AAAAAAABIQI/AYD7d3Li8L4hnGE0vz934PtxA3HJZebcgCPcBGAsYHg/s2400/IMG_20210323_135523.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-XFxgYDq_RRU/YFuoQxcdn1I/AAAAAAABIQI/AYD7d3Li8L4hnGE0vz934PtxA3HJZebcgCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_135523.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br>2. Tuo metu nuvalome ir susmulkiname svogūnus, morkas, pomidorą, česnaką. Tai patogu padaryti su maisto smulkinuvu (<i>food processor</i>).<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-78AQ75jTCNo/YFuohGebJeI/AAAAAAABIQQ/lXa5CQSz17srvzH-zmAFwUvuXLA7QlfmgCPcBGAsYHg/s3120/IMG_20210323_140629.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-78AQ75jTCNo/YFuohGebJeI/AAAAAAABIQQ/lXa5CQSz17srvzH-zmAFwUvuXLA7QlfmgCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_140629.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-NpPuomKpGcI/YFuohE4_kzI/AAAAAAABIQQ/USWhOsigs-E3_SQ2JQfCZcXQgKdDBA1zwCPcBGAsYHg/s3120/IMG_20210323_141118.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-NpPuomKpGcI/YFuohE4_kzI/AAAAAAABIQQ/USWhOsigs-E3_SQ2JQfCZcXQgKdDBA1zwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_141118.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div>3. Išvirtus sojos kubelius nukošiame ir apkepame aliejuje, keptuvėje.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-nd9Vnl55SXA/YFuonfpYUzI/AAAAAAABIQU/WE__fcD5F94J-kC1U0qg_hupTEqQyNJPACPcBGAsYHg/s3120/IMG_20210323_141332.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-nd9Vnl55SXA/YFuonfpYUzI/AAAAAAABIQU/WE__fcD5F94J-kC1U0qg_hupTEqQyNJPACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_141332.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><br></div><div>4. Atskirai keptuvėje, aliejuje kepame ir smulkintas daržoves.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Daržovėms apkepus, įdedame šaukštą miltų, įpilame apie stiklinę verdančio vandens, įdedame lauro lapą, druskos ir 2-3 rutuliukus kvapniųjų pipirų. Paliekame pasitroškinti ant mažesnės ugnies. Ištroškinus padažą, lauro lapą ir kvapniuosius pipirus geriau išimti.</div><div><br></div><div>5. Sujungiame padažą su sojų kubeliais. Štai ir veganiškas guliašas.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-x2x-nsVsK5c/YFuo_ZXSkeI/AAAAAAABIQg/7RxIWXtWjEoTXE4v44912fVwMOcBA6BUgCPcBGAsYHg/s4004/IMG_20210323_145445.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-x2x-nsVsK5c/YFuo_ZXSkeI/AAAAAAABIQg/7RxIWXtWjEoTXE4v44912fVwMOcBA6BUgCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_145445.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>Galima tiekti su bulvėmis, ryžiais, grikiais ir kitu garnyru, šalia dera salotos, pvz. šviežių kopūstų.</div></div><div><br></div><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9P6pW_z6l5Q/YFupsN_3TqI/AAAAAAABIQw/_baX50BkH20BsoOZw7DgUBviRDVH9Aq3QCPcBGAsYHg/s2448/IMG_20210323_213215.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9P6pW_z6l5Q/YFupsN_3TqI/AAAAAAABIQw/_baX50BkH20BsoOZw7DgUBviRDVH9Aq3QCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_213215.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr><tr><td>Su bulvėmis</td></tr></tbody></table><br><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-VPPiHdHDMlg/YFupsARgu_I/AAAAAAABIQw/gyjlsZhX6ygI6tBcw2NNPukSfgtcuZXAwCPcBGAsYHg/s3264/IMG_20210323_145715.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411104642im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-VPPiHdHDMlg/YFupsARgu_I/AAAAAAABIQw/gyjlsZhX6ygI6tBcw2NNPukSfgtcuZXAwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210323_145715.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr><tr><td>Su daržovėmis</td></tr></tbody></table><div><br><br></div><br>",
